# S8.1 witness, library C (translated with `--library --construct lib_c_new`): its `lib_c_next` takes an input that
# the owner's model of it does not describe, so the owner's written call `c1\lib_c_next()` cannot be formed for it.
int: count 50
fn: lib_c_next (int: by) int
    node\count: node\count + by
    return: node\count
